"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Mokha's capture would bring the Iran-backed group closer to controlling the Bab al-Mandab Strait waterway, which is a key shipping route.\",            \"english_title\": \"Mokha's Capture\",            \"translated_version\": \"Si capturan Mokha, el grupo apoyado por Ir\u00e1n estar\u00eda m\u00e1s cerca de controlar el estrecho de Bab al-Mandab, que es una ruta importante para barcos.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Captura de Mokha\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Analysts question if the US president's election year offer is workable, legal, or affordable.\",            \"english_title\": \"US President's Offer\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los analistas dudan si la oferta del presidente de EE.UU. en a\u00f1o de elecciones es posible, legal o barata.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Oferta del Presidente de EE.UU.\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A coach carrying 48 Dutch passengers overturned, leaving several people dead.\",            \"english_title\": \"Coach Accident\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un autob\u00fas con 48 pasajeros holandeses volc\u00f3, dejando a varias personas muertas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Accidente de Autob\u00fas\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Officials say there was a stampede as people fled a fire that engulfed two schools in the eastern rebel-held city of Bukavu.\",            \"english_title\": \"Fire in Bukavu\",            \"translated_version\": \"Los oficiales dicen que hubo una estampida cuando la gente escapaba de un fuego que quem\u00f3 dos escuelas en la ciudad de Bukavu controlada por rebeldes.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Fuego en Bukavu\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Declassified documents show Spanish and Moroccan authorities were alerted to social media calls for a mass migrant crossing the day before tens o